\title{Fixed-weight harness adaptation}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{agent}
\tag{persistent-state}

\p{The executable model artifact, active context, explicitly managed
computation, and persistent harness state are distinct parts of an agent.
Replayability depends on the rule that materializes state from events,
as well as the recorded inputs and execution versions.}

